     1019     .
     1020   end.
     1021       for each buf_temp-prt-obj
     1022       ,first buf_prt-obj exclusive-lock
     1023         where recid(buf_prt-obj) = buf_temp-prt-obj.prt-obj-recid
     1024       on error undo, return error return-value
     1025       :
